Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 21:59:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix stat drops writing stage into wDisguiseBusted; 7 audit
 regressions green

The battle tester's Intimidate smoke test exposed a real regression:
BattleCommand_StatDown's ability-drop marker (.ComputerMiss) clobbered hl,
so every stat drop wrote its new stage into wDisguiseBusted instead of the
stat-level array. Fixed with push/pop hl; release ROM md5 is now
d9142604b53563d98c94df927c2590da.

make test: 14 passed / 0 failed in ~5s (7 smoke + audit 1a, 1b, 2b x2,
5b, 7, 8 with golden values). New lead logged: Thrash fatigue never
triggers (audit 10 skip note + handoff).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
